{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792044720, "covers_from": "2026-10-15T06:12:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-15T06:13:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792044780, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-15T06:12:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 40718, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "中山區上班搭捷運，車門開始時間根本不到1分鐘，從進站到車廂根本來不及", "display_name": "中山代表 LISA", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T06:12:11+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 407, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "現任市長上任後，行人穿越馬路的秒數變少了\n對長輩、特別是身障人士，真的是太不體貼了", "display_name": "松山代表 No.407", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T06:12:25+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 4368, "sprite_key": "beaver_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "道路可以從路基就好好整地，把路鋪平嗎？整天羨慕日本道路多好多平，結果台北市的路面高高低低，一堆坑洞。", "display_name": "北投代表 No.4,368", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T06:12:40+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 25959, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "我們的首都台北大巨蛋有老鼠真的會丟臉丟到國外去希望能改善", "display_name": "大安代表 No.25,959", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T06:12:49+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 22835, "sprite_key": "penguin_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "教育", "content": "希望各個學校的音樂課可以多元一點", "display_name": "士林代表 No.22,835", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T06:12:55+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 38868, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "環境", "content": "台北的公廁可以都換成免治馬桶嗎", "display_name": "北投代表 No.38,868", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 407